flowchart TD
  A[Alert / detection] --> B[Declare incident + assign commander]
  B --> C[Classify severity and impact]
  C --> D[Contain active harm]
  D --> E[Preserve redacted evidence + custody]
  E --> F[Eradicate root cause]
  F --> G[Known-good immutable release]
  G --> H{Recovery gates pass?}
  H -->|No| F
  H -->|Yes| I[Canary / staged recovery]
  I --> J[Monitor recurrence]
  J --> K[Blameless postmortem + owned actions]
